Template: nvidia-legacy-96xx-driver/eol-security-warning
Type: note
Description: NVIDIA 96xx is an end-of-life driver with known vulnerabilities
 You are installing NVIDIA 96.43.23 (the 96xx legacy series).
 .
 This driver reached end of life and receives NO security updates from NVIDIA.
 It has publicly documented, unpatched vulnerabilities. Kernel and Xorg
 compatibility is provided only by community patches.
 .
 Recommended only for: isolated or offline machines, or hardware with no
 supported-driver alternative. On an internet-connected desktop, prefer nouveau
 or newer hardware.
